<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Nov car registrations rise 6.3 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Nov car registrations rise 6.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations rose a seasonally-adjusted 6.3 percent in November to 54,946, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists had generally been looking for a rise of around 3.0 percent.</p>
</text>
